The <ansi fg="command">Purge Affliction</ansi> spell neutralizes foreign agents, toxins, and
afflictions within the target's body, cleansing them of poisons and
debilitating conditions. An essential tool for keeping allies healthy
when facing venomous creatures or cursed environments.

<ansi fg="yellow">Usage: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="command">cast purge-affliction [target]</ansi>

<ansi fg="yellow">Details: </ansi>

  <ansi fg="yellow">Type:        </ansi> Help Single
  <ansi fg="yellow">School:      </ansi> Vital
  <ansi fg="yellow">Base Folds:  </ansi> N/A
  <ansi fg="yellow">Conv. Cost:  </ansi> 75
  <ansi fg="yellow">Effect:      </ansi> Purges poisons and afflictions from a single target

